# The Troll Priest spell quests: Hex of Weakness at 10 (5652) and
# Shadowguard at 20 (5680), both from Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar's Valley of
# Spirits.
# Sources: quests.json and npcs.json for the givers; Forever's
# Priest class quest list (data/local/quest-audit/: both
# unchanged); classicwowforever.com/racials for the spells (Hex of Weakness
# and Shadowguard stay Troll spells).
# horde/orc-troll/01-durotar and 03-silverpine-forest carry Hex of Weakness
# on the route (5654, from Tai'jin in Razor Hill) and horde/04-the-barrens
# carries Shadowguard; this guide repeats them for anyone off the route. The
# game offers one quest of each set.
# Not checked in game: written from the sources above.

step Hex of Weakness
  tip At 10, go to Ur'kyo in the Valley of Spirits, on Orgrimmar's west side. Priest trainers elsewhere (Tai'jin in Razor Hill, Miles Welsh in Thunder Bluff) send you to him with a quest of the same name.
  level 10
  accept 5652                                 -- Ur'kyo
  turnin 5652                                 -- Ur'kyo: Hex of Weakness

step Shadowguard
  tip At 20, Ur'kyo teaches Shadowguard. Miles Welsh in Thunder Bluff and Aelthalyste in the Undercity send you to him with a quest of the same name.
  level 20
  accept 5680                                 -- Ur'kyo
  turnin 5680                                 -- Ur'kyo: Shadowguard
